{"tool_name":"rnainter","contents":["oeb","bioschemas","biotools"],"fetched_metadata":{"biotools":{"id":"rnainter","home":"http://www.rna-society.org/rnainter/","summary":"RNA interactome repository with increased coverage and annotation.\n\nRNAInter: RNA Interactome Database.","addition_date":"2021-01-18T06:58:27Z","last_update_date":"2021-02-07T12:18:07Z","biotools_curie":"biotools:rnainter","credit":[{"email":"wangdong@ems.hrbmu.edu.cn","name":"Dong Wang","orcidid":"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7949-5285","typeEntity":"Person"}],"edit_permission":{"type":"private"},"function":[{"operation":[{"term":"RNA binding site prediction","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_3902"},{"term":"RNA secondary structure alignment","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_0502"},{"term":"RNA secondary structure prediction","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_0278"},{"term":"RNA structure prediction","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_2441"},{"term":"RNA-binding protein prediction","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_3901"}]}],"name":"RNAInter","owner":"zsmag19","publication":[{"doi":"10.1093/NAR/GKZ804","metadata":{"abstract":"\u00a9 2019 The Author(s). Published by Oxford University Press on behalf of Nucleic Acids Research.Research on RNA-associated interactions has exploded in recent years, and increasing numbers of studies are not limited to RNA-RNA and RNA-protein interactions but also include RNA-DNA/compound interactions. To facilitate the development of the interactome and promote understanding of the biological functions and molecular mechanisms of RNA, we updated RAID v2.0 to RNAInter (RNA Interactome Database), a repository for RNA-associated interactions that is freely accessible at http://www.rna-society.org/rnainter/or http://www.rna-society.org/raid/. Compared to RAID v2.0, new features in RNAInter include (i) 8-fold more interaction data and 94 additional species; (ii) more definite annotations organized, including RNA editing/localization/modification/structure and homology interaction; (iii) advanced functions including fuzzy/batch search, interaction network and RNA dynamic expression and (iv) four embedded RNA interactome tools: RIscoper, IntaRNA, PRIdictor and DeepBind. Consequently, RNAInter contains >41 million RNA-associated interaction entries, involving more than 450 thousand unique molecules, including RNA, protein, DNA and compound. Overall, RNAInter provides a comprehensive RNA interactome resource for researchers and paves the way to investigate the regulatory landscape of cellular RNAs.","authors":[{"name":"Cui T."},{"name":"Huang Y."},{"name":"Lin Y."},{"name":"Liu T."},{"name":"Tan P."},{"name":"Wang D."},{"name":"Wang Z."},{"name":"Yu J."},{"name":"Zhang Y."}],"citationCount":47,"date":"2020-01-01T00:00:00Z","journal":"Nucleic Acids Research","title":"RNAInter in 2020: RNA interactome repository with increased coverage and annotation"},"pmcid":"PMC6943043","pmid":"31906603"}],"topic":[{"term":"Molecular interactions, pathways and networks","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_0602"},{"term":"Nucleic acid structure analysis","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_0097"},{"term":"RNA","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_0099"},{"term":"RNA immunoprecipitation","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_3794"},{"term":"Transcription factors and regulatory sites","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_0749"}]},"bioschemas":{"name":"RNAInter","home":"https://bio.tools/rnainter","summary":"RNA interactome repository with increased coverage and annotation.\n\nRNAInter: RNA Interactome Database.","tool_type":"sc:SoftwareApplication"},"oeb":{"metrics":[{"@id":"https://openebench.bsc.es/monitor/metrics/biotools:rnainter/undefined/www.rna-society.org","@license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/","@nmsp":"biotools","@type":"metrics","deprecated":true,"project":{"build":{},"deployment":{},"publications":[{"entries":[{"cit_count":139,"citations":[{"count":3,"year":"2026"},{"count":8,"year":"2025"},{